            <description><![CDATA[<h3>Parrot can perch in your menu bar</h3><ul><li>The Profiles page opens again in the Settings window you get with ⌘,.</li><li>Hide Parrot from the Dock while its window is closed, in Settings &gt; General.</li><li>The meeting window fits your screen again, and Detect speakers says who it heard.</li><li>Share a call's report with your team as a clean PDF, from the Share menu.</li></ul><p><a href="https://openparrot.app/changelog#v0.29.3">Read the full story</a></p>
]]></description>
